OL,3,GNEWSAMore than third of deaths of
OL,4,Aex-prisoners on probation drug related,
OL,5,Asays report
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than a third of deaths of former
OL,8,Fprisoners on probation in Wales in a
OL,9,Fyear were drug related, according to a
OL,10,Fnew report.
OL,12,FThe Wales Governance Centre at Cardiff
OL,13,FUniversity, which has published the
OL,14,Freport, is urging politicians to tackle
OL,15,F"systematic failures" in the criminal
OL,16,Fjustice system.
OL,18,FThe deaths figure is higher than the
OL,19,Fproportion recorded across England and
OL,20,FWales as a whole, where deaths in this
OL,21,Fcategory accounted for just over a
OL,22,Ffifth of the total.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
